# Clean Code baseline

App/source edits only. Gates: [`change-control-manifest.mdc`](./change-control-manifest.mdc) · scoped `ai-rules/*/`.

## Core rules

1. **Small scope** — only what the request needs.
2. **Clear names** — intent over trivia.
3. **Single responsibility** — extract when it clarifies.
4. **No duplicate logic** — shared helpers when practical.
5. **Fail safely** — explicit errors; no silent swallow.
6. **Stable behavior** — no unrelated refactors in the same patch.
7. **Tests when behavior changes** — at least one verify path.
8. **No dead code** — after caller redirect, grep old symbol and remove if zero refs ([`callee-redirect-cleanup`](./patching/callee-redirect-cleanup.mdc)).

Style: early returns · named constants over magic values · rare meaningful comments · match project formatter.

## Verify before reply

Follow [`change-control-manifest.mdc`](./change-control-manifest.mdc) § **Verify gate**: IDENTIFY → RUN → READ.

Lint/type/test when available · cite output · report verified vs not run · never claim fixed on prediction alone · after verified patch: [`vault-autolog`](workflow/vault-autolog.mdc) (manifest step 9).

